ACTION REPORT    

Here's what happened to Your Majesty this turn:

  In spring, Leif Erikson prepared his armies to defend Quebec and the 
surrounding provinces.

  Thus endeth the adventures of Leif Erikson for this year.


  Your Majesty, I have news to report of wanderers in our kingdom:  
  The 370th Heavy Cavalry suffered from a disastrous raiding attempt in 
Labrador and sank to Green quality.


  Here is the financial report for Leif Erikson's kingdom: this turn, the 
Kingdom collected 0 gold in revenue.  0 gold was expended to finance our 
leaders.  0 gold was expended to maintain our armies.  Leif Erikson was left 
with 16 gold in the treasury.


LETTER REPORTS

  O King of Kings, thy heroes have travelled around the globe in
search of adventure and conquest.  I have faithfully kept their
correspondence, and now I present it to thee:


From: Inanna
To: Leif Erikson

  Honored Sovereign, 

  With the advent of the spring season I prepared to quench my thirst for 
adventure.  I prepared my forces to defend the Denmark Strait and the 
surrounding provinces.

  Thy humble servant,   Inanna


